\title{Pathway scoring and overlap diagnostics}
\description{Experimental pathway functions for over-representation testing, weighted rank scores, permutation tests, overlap grouping, and threshold sensitivity analysis.}
\details{Feature-to-compound and compound-to-pathway mappings define the candidate evidence. Shared candidate compounds can support multiple pathways; overlap and uniqueness summaries describe this dependence. The pathway module is developed separately from annotation, and its statistical calibration remains unvalidated.}
